[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:41. Penny's Bag]
[00:00.420]Lesson 41 | 第41课
[00:02.730]Is that bag heavy, Mary? | 玛丽，那个包很重吗？
[00:05.880]Not very. | 不太重。
[00:07.240]Here. | 给。
[00:08.295]Put it on this chair. | 把它放在这张椅子上。
[00:10.550]What's in it? | 里面有什么？
[00:12.465]A piece of cheese. | 一块奶酪。
[00:15.060]A loaf of bread. | 一条面包。
[00:17.790]A bar of soap. | 一块肥皂。
[00:20.715]A bar of chocolate. | 一块巧克力。
[00:23.705]A bottle of milk. | 一瓶牛奶。
[00:26.600]A pound of sugar. | 一磅糖。
[00:29.450]Half a pound of coffee. | 半磅咖啡。
[00:32.605]A quarter of a pound of tea. | 四分之一磅茶叶。
[00:36.080]And a tin of tobacco. | 和一听烟草。
[00:38.895]Is that tin of tobacco for me? | 那听烟草是给我的吗？
[00:41.820]Well, | 嗯，
[00:43.020]it's certainly not for me. | 它肯定不是给我的。